The video DiT's window-softmax attention and linear branch
(runtime/metal/kernels/video/dit/window_attention.metal and
linear_branch.metal, runtime/video/ops/WindowTable.mm) and install/h3.py
follow OpenVDN's code. Apache License, Version 2.0
