FastVideo (https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo)

The TAEH3 preview decoder (runtime/metal/kernels/video/preview,
runtime/video/ops/PreviewDecoder.mm, install/h3.py) follows FastVideo's TAEH3
port (fastvideo/mlx_runtime/minimax_h3_taeh3.py). The FastH3 variants
implement FastVideo's VSA-H3 attention
(fastvideo/attention/backends/video_sparse_attn_h3.py: tile geometry, pooled
routing, top-k, gated compressed branch, keyframe rows as a dense segment)
and its FastH3 sampling contract (DMD rungs and shifts) in
runtime/metal/kernels/video/dit/vsa.metal, runtime/video/ops/VsaTable.mm,
runtime/video/model/FastH3.mm and install/fasth3.py. The FastH3 student
weights (FastVideo/FastVideo-FastH3-8-Step-V2,
FastVideo/FastVideo-FastH3-4-step-Preview-v1-*) are derivatives of MiniMax
H3 under the MiniMax H3 Community License Agreement; none is part of Splash.
Apache License, Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

minimax-h3-mlx (https://github.com/PipeNetwork/minimax-h3-mlx)

The video VAE tile plan (runtime/video/ops/Geometry.cpp), the request
preparation (runtime/video/model/Prep.mm), the audio VAE decoder
(runtime/video/ops/AudioDecoder.mm) and the rotary tables and audio weights of
install/h3.py follow this MLX port of MiniMax H3. Apache License, Version 2.0
(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

