converts (install/fasth3.py); none is part of Splash. They are Model Derivatives of MiniMax
H3 under the MiniMax H3 Community License Agreement, Copyright (c) 2026
Mellis, Inc.
The reference decoding and normalization of server/references.py follow
Pika H3 Flex's example code (pika_h3.core.media, pika_h3.core.conditioning).
Apache License, Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

